        "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything",
        "aux_id": "yolain/ComfyUI-Easy-Use"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Style: luminous photographic aesthetics defined by strong backlighting, radiant edge illumination, subtle translucency effects, atmospheric depth, graceful tonal transitions, and a heightened sense of visual separation, creating elegant and emotionally evocative imagery through carefully controlled exposure, naturalistic light diffusion, and refined portrait craftsmanship, reminiscent of Peter Lindbergh and Paolo Roversi, inspired by Vogue editorials and In the Mood for Love.. Subject:一位黑色长发的年轻亚洲女子站在阳光斑驳的森林中，头发自然披散在肩头并编成一条松散的长辫，用紫色发圈固定。她的皮肤白皙，嘴唇微张，笑容甜美，表情温柔。她身穿一袭白色露肩上衣，领口和袖口饰有精致蕾丝花边，胸前系着蝴蝶结，下摆微微收紧露出紫色腰带；脖子上戴着一条金色细链，坠着一枚椭圆形紫色宝石吊坠。她的右手轻轻捏住一朵紫色风铃草，花瓣舒展，花茎细长带有绿色叶片。柔和的金色阳光从左侧树叶间洒落，整体画面呈现温暖。"
      ],
